t for casual fans and serious players\n- The All-in-One, Sports Super app — only on Sleeper\n\nDownload Sleeper today — make your picks, cash in your wins.\n\n—\n*For Picks and SleeperSafe products users must be 18+ (Player Picks: 19 in AL/NE; 21 in MA/VA). Team Picks products involve degrees of risk, such as loss of funds, and participation is subject to eligibility requirements and applicable law. Nothing herein is a solicitation, recommendation, or offer to buy or sell any financial instrument, or to engage in any transaction. See our General Terms of Use at sleeper.com/terms for additional restrictions. Use responsibly. Contact 1-800-MY-RESET for help. © Blitz Studios, Inc.",
